  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Support Fund (WSF) 2023-2026. impact 23-0000170</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact 23-0000170 This is a support fund for implementing a number of joint activities with mutual objectives to support portfolio management, as well as the Government of Bangladesh and our partner organizations (incl. universities, consultants, implementing partners, NGOs, NPOs etc) continuing the development collaboration between Netherland and Bangladesh in the broad sector of Water, Climate and Agriculture with links to other cross sectoral issues like Gender, peace, humanity, DRR, migration, sustainable economic development, enabling environment, sustainability, and social progress.</narrative>
  </description>
